(p/'executive-summary.md').write_text(f'# SEO and AI-search audit — {origin}\n\nAudit date: 2026-09-08.\n\n## Status\n\nPASS WITH RECOMMENDATIONS. Final deployment receipts are recorded in after-provenance.json and production-summary.json.\n\n## Outcome\n\n{changes}\n\nThe untouched pinned CI baseline contains {b["canonical_pages"]} canonical pages. The after build contains {a["canonical_pages"]}. See before-after.md for exact error counts and page additions, issues.csv for root causes, and the Git history for changed files. The release itself is source-backed; claimed user benefits are limited to accurate discovery and usable examples.\n\n## Verification\n\nFull generated crawl, sitemap/HTML-link discovery, metadata, headings, canonical routes, internal links, images, JSON-LD and native repository contracts. Separate production crawls, redirects, robots, sitemap, crawler-user-agent probes, external links and mobile Lighthouse receipts. Baseline archive and per-file hashes were sealed before source edits. Deployment and runtime provenance are recorded separately from local diagnostic attempts.\n\n## Limits and next measurements\n\nAuthenticated visibility, field CWV, search-console coverage and controlled AI citations: {na}. Search observations do not establish rank or absence from an index. No composite SEO or AI-readiness score is invented. Follow the 7/28/60/90-day plan in recommendations.md.\n')
